  "runtimeSupport": {
    "board": "lilygo-t5-v2-3-1",
    "status": "diagnostic",
    "scope": "已接入精确 T5 V2.3.1 的 DEPG0213BN/SSD1680：可见 122×250、实际控制器 RAM 176×296、忙信号与显像分离、GPIO39 用户键和 SPI TF 卡；没有套用 V2.4 的 GPIO12 电源。",
    "unsupported": [
      "No complete official factory, Meshtastic or SoftRF firmware has been executed; native MMIO tests establish only the stated board protocol subset.",
      "No physical hardware validation, radio propagation, analog supply/battery model or USB electrical emulation is claimed.",
      "An e-paper RAM write is not a completed frame: BUSY and a frozen pending image are separate, reset/power loss cancel unfinished refresh, and the previous optical image is retained.",
      "Analog LUT waveforms, temperature/voltage, ghosting, calibrated reflectance and physical update-time validation are unmodeled. The visible RGB565 values are digital debug colors.",
      "SPI bytes require the exact clock/MOSI/CS/DC and reset/supply routes. Unsupported command/data effects are not substituted with host-drawn frames.",
      "The current Factory example describes V2.4 and GPIO12 panel power; it is not copied into V2.3.1.",
      "Another bundled old GxDEPG0213BN driver adds one byte to X addresses. This profile selects the explicitly V2.3.1-named GxEPD2 zero-origin driver; physical offsets are not automatically guessed or repaired.",
      "Only the six padding bits of the128-wide drawing canvas and all other controller RAM outside122x250 glass remain invisible. Arbitrary custom LUT effects, source-output pin remapping and red glass are unmodeled.",
      "GPIO19 LED, battery ADC35 and other charging functions are sourced separately but not implemented in this display/SD subset."
    ],
    "firmwareCompatibility": "No factory image is claimed working by a board protocol test."
  },
